# Download the pinned llama.cpp macOS runtime for local packaging.
apps/desktop/vendor/llama-b10182/*
!apps/desktop/vendor/llama-b10182/LICENSE
!apps/desktop/vendor/llama-b10182/README.md

# The crew's shared room is COMMITTED — `.crew/BOARD.md`, `FINDINGS.md`,
# `MEMORY.md`, `ROSTER.md` and `HOUSE-RULES.md` are the memory whose whole
# purpose is surviving a restart, and they lived in `/tmp` until 2026-09-05,
# which is the one directory macOS deletes. Only the raw per-seat transcripts
# are ignored: they are large, they are superseded by FINDINGS.md, and nothing
# reads them twice.
.crew/runs/

